Z||000008||FormulaJoe||11-14-2001||08:26 PM||||I was thinking of doing something like that to my car.  On the later cars (87/88) it should be easy to do, just create a stop where you want the mechanism to stop.  Should be able to add something to the original stops that are there already.  Then fabricate a new mask ( headlight surrond, that black piece) with the new angle and find some new narrow lights to put into them.  That would be the biggest problem, finding lights.  Brightness and legality are the two limiting factors.  I would like something a little (ha, a lot) brighter than stock.  ||||reg||6
